	(text_box "The keypad interface supports a 3×4 or 4×4 matrix membrane keypad.\n- Button scanning: Key presses are detected by continuously polling the keypad and toggling rows and columns between HIGH/LOW and INPUT/OUTPUT states.\n- Application-defined mapping: The functionality and usage of individual keypad buttons are defined by the application and are not fixed."
